# SPA fallback: serve the app shell for every route so deep links
# like /launches and /map work on direct visits and refreshes.
#
# Cloudflare Pages' _redirects parser rejects a bare `/* /index.html 200`
# rule as a false-positive infinite loop (its clean-URL normalization
# treats a request for /index.html itself as looping back through this
# same rule) and silently drops EVERY rule in the file when it does,
# per the build log ("Parsed 0 valid redirect rules"). Excluding the
# destination file from the wildcard's own match avoids that false
# positive: requests for the literal /index.html file skip straight to
# static serving instead of re-entering this rule.
/index.html   /index.html   200
/*            /index.html   200
